the knowledge base homestead_exemption includes:

the text of the_model is at "sources/homestead-exemption.dmn".

the apply url of the eligible of the next steps is "https://tax-services.phila.gov/_/".

the help url of the eligible of the next steps is "https://www.phila.gov/services/payments-assistance-taxes/taxes/property-and-real-estate-taxes/get-real-estate-tax-relief/get-the-homestead-exemption/".

the help phone of the eligible of the next steps is "(215) 686-9200".

the body of the eligible of the next steps is "Apply through the Philadelphia Tax Center. You do not need an online account. You can also apply by phone or use the paper application on the program page.

- Apply by December 1. Applying by October 1 helps put the exemption on your next bill.
- If a previous owner is still listed, call the hotline or use the paper application.
- After approval, you usually do not need to apply again unless your deed changes.".

the note of the ineligible of the next steps is "If your name is not on the deed, you may still qualify for a conditional Homestead Exemption. Check the program page for the paper application and supporting documents.".

