rule ten_year_tax_abatement_service_1 with provenance the model at decision TenYearTaxAbatementService:
the ten year tax abatement service result is true if
    the ten year tax abatement of the simple checks of the situation is true.

rule ten_year_tax_abatement_service_2 with provenance the model at decision TenYearTaxAbatementService:
